<title>UK: Tordom sets A$100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Tordom sets A$100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Toronto Dominion Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TORDOM BANK</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.75 PCT  MATURITY    28.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.415   PAY DATE    28.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/CA/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW CAN/ONTARIO  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
